<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68343" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μολοσσός</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολοβρ-ττός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <u>Molossian</u>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄργανον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάπεδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					829
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.146
			</span></i>, al.:—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μολοσσίς</span></b> , 
				Att.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολοβρ-ττίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.39
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Μολοσσίς</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>) <u>Molossia</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.297b
			</span></i>: also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μολοσσία</span></b> ,
				ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				7.38
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μολοσσικός</span></b> , 
				Att.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολοβρ-ττικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, χεῖρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					795
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύων</span> M. a kind of wolf-dog
			used by shepherds, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				416
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολοσσός, ὁ</span>, in Metric, the foot <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">¯</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heph.
				3.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.2
			</span></i>.</div>
